data: {"id": "2189492a091847e9-thinking-layer-247", "run_id": "2189492a091847e9", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "Pod `workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn` 的实际状态为 `Error`，且 `READY` 为 `0/1`，这证实了它是一个异常 Pod。鉴于其较高的重启次数（22次）和 `Error` 状态，最可能的归因是容器崩溃（OOMKilled）或配置/启动错误。\n\n我将获取相关的 Runbook 以便进一步诊断。考虑到 `Error` 状态且重启频繁，`pod-oomkilled.md` 和 `pod-crashloop-runtime.md` 是最相关的候选。我先获取 `pod-oomkilled.md` 来检查内存相关证据。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788797133789}

