。\n    *   **追踪维度**：Trace 数据中的属性 `aiops.observed_mode: config_missing_exit` 与日志互相印证，表明应用以特定的业务异常模式退出。\n    *   **系统状态维度**：退出码为 78（通常为特定应用退出码），配合 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态，确认了这种非随机、高可重复性的启动失败模式正是导致当前 Pod 无法运行的直接原因。\n\n*   **局限性/未知项**：虽然明确了是“配置缺失”导致，但输入事实（及诊断元数据）指出尚无法确定 `ConfigMap workload-code` 中具体**缺失了哪个配置项名称**，也无法还原触发该异常的**具体代码逻辑分支**。但这已足以解释当前的集群异常状态。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.9m\n├─ 问题定位: 25.1s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 77.0s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn: 77.0s (Evidence 70.0s, RCA 6.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 13.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn**: pod-oomkilled\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 115.977, "metrics": {"run_id": "2189492a091847e9", "mttr": {"value": "1.9m", "seconds": 115.98476386070251, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "56%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-oomkilled", "pass": true, "score": 0.9, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-oomkilled"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.9, "weighted_score": 0.1